    <bioghist id="aspace_2afe690ac4cd8e7b2acdcbf7b5a76fdc">
      <head>Historical Note</head>
      <p>The Women's Studies Program was created in 1972. It became the Department of Women's Studies in 1990. It is currently called the Department of Women's, Gender, and Sexuality Studies.</p>
    </bioghist>
    <scopecontent id="aspace_36425322a71e7a52713bbee837906ab2">
      <head>Scope and Contents</head>
      <p>This collection contains 11 cassette recordings, transcripts of the recordings, and consent forms.</p>
    </scopecontent>
    <arrangement id="aspace_a799096fd5917bd5d2904dc2b569f6b6">
      <head>Arrangement of the Collection</head>
      <p>The collection is arranged chronologically by interview date.</p>
    </arrangement>
